# F-Droid runs `fdroid rewritemeta` in CI and fails the build if a metadata
# file differs by so much as a line ending. This repo is worked on with
# core.autocrlf=true, which hands back CRLF copies on Windows, and a CRLF copy
# of the recipe pasted into fdroiddata is exactly what failed !46150 once.
# Keep YAML as LF in the working tree so the copy source is always right.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
